{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.poster.avif?t=1759191257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.webm?t=1759191257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.mp4?t=1759191257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Forklift Certified</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>GET READY TO BE CERTIFIED!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Forklift Certified</i>, a unique single-player 3D top-down puzzle experience where you can kick back, unwind, and enjoy clever challenges at your own pace. Take control of a forklift to navigate intricate puzzles, activate mechanisms, and conquer challenges in 12 handcrafted levels, each set in a distinct and creative environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Engaging Forklift-Based Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your forklift to interact with the environment: activate buttons, flip switches, and deliver puzzle pieces to their correct locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>12 Handcrafted Levels Across Unique Locations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in diverse environments, from an industrial trainyard to the relaxing farm, through a mysterious dungeon, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Time Trials</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to beat bronze, silver, or gold times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>Find the Certification Manual Pages</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level features a hidden certification manual page waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f <strong>Certifications</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and achievements with a variety of certifications to complete. Can you become fully forklift certified?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Forklift Skins</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip a variety of fun and quirky forklift designs to personalize your ride.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cel-shaded graphics and a dynamic soundtrack that create a calming and engaging atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364470?t=1759191257","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759191257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/8573a1c25ba206bb415ac475cd76837907ff1430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759191257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/8573a1c25ba206bb415ac475cd76837907ff1430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759191257","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3418550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_t